# .askai-ignore — folders / page routes excluded from HydraDB "Ask AI" ingestion.
#
# One folder or page route per line, relative to the repo root, matching the
# Mintlify route WITHOUT the .mdx/.md extension. Rules:
#   • lines starting with "#" are comments; blank lines are ignored
#   • a trailing "/" (or a bare folder) matches everything under that folder
#   • an exact route matches just that one page
#   • "*" globs within a path segment, "**" globs across segments
#
# Consumed by askai-harness/ingest-docs.mjs: matching pages are never ingested,
# and any that were ingested before are pruned from the collection on the next run.

# ── Deprecated v1 API reference ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# v1 is deprecated and superseded by api-reference/v2/*. We don't want Ask AI to
# retrieve, cite, or recommend it. (v2 lives under api-reference/v2/ and stays.)
api-reference/index
api-reference/sdks
api-reference/error-responses
api-reference/endpoint/
